    The changeling hive has boarded the station, ready to take anything it desires - be it your equipment, your faces, or your lives!

changeling-role-greeting =
    You are a Changeling, a highly intelligent predator reliant on devouring other life.
    Do what you can to survive without being detected. Try to hide your true nature to the best of your ability.
    You are hungry and will not make it long without sustenance, but remember that they are more afraid of you than you are of them.
    Kill. Consume. Hide. Survive.

changeling-briefing =
    You are a changeling.
    You are able to utilize the biomass and assume the identities of those you consume to evade a grim fate.

changeling-role-greeting-short =
    You are a changeling who has absorbed and taken the initial form of {$name}.

